rsaken/431429-trying-out-2-0?p=431739#post431739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, Retias posted in my looking-for thread in the other subforum, we are all in that boat. Sounds like the world's suffering from a storyteller shortage :-)</div> </div> </div> </div>And we storytellers are suffering from a time shortage!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T07:10:04-07:00","id":432600,"title":"","content":"Alright, I've come to the conclusion of trying to run a game of this myself. Can anyone interested throw me a PM? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T07:29:54-07:00","id":432610,"title":"","content":"Hey guys,<br /> <br /> <br /> For those who can't play yet but don't mind living vicariously through the lives of others you can checkout <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/378460-a-werewolf-chronicle-in-paris\">Paris, City of Light</a> Podcast. The GM is the wonderfully talented Chris Allen (Acrozatarim on these forums) who as you might know was one of the writers for 2<sup>nd</sup> Edition and we had the chance to start a campaign a couple of weeks ago, so more episodes will be added soon. Check out the Campaign Wiki <a href=\"http://wiki.rpg.net/index.php/Werewolf_Paris\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, for background info, character sheets and npc's. <br /> <br /> <br /> Episode 1 - The fledgeling pack hunts for a dead wolf\u2019s bones.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://insanitywetrust.wordpress.com/2015/03/05/werewolf-the-forsaken-paris-city-of-light-episode-1-part-1/\" target=\"_blank\">Part 1</a> and <a href=\"https://insanitywetrust.wordpress.com/2015/03/05/werewolf-the-forsaken-paris-city-of-light-episode-1-part-2/\" target=\"_blank\">Part 2</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Episode 2 - The pack seeks a name, and lays claim to their territory.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://insanitywetrust.wordpress.com/2015/03/08/werewolf-the-forsaken-paris-city-of-light-episode-2-part-1/\" target=\"_blank\">Part 1</a> and <a href=\"https://insanitywetrust.wordpress.com/2015/03/08/werewolf-the-forsaken-paris-city-of-light-episode-2-part-2/\" target=\"_blank\">Part 2</a><br /> <br /> <br /> Hope you enjoy and you check out more of our games <a href=\"https://insanitywetrust.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2354,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2354-mremann","user":"mremann","date":". 03-08-2015, 10:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2354-mremann","name":"mremann","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T09:49:21-07:00","id":432683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"